  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C to F: (x × 9/5) + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F to C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n\n    <div class=\"result-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --panel: #2b2e4a;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --muted: #a8b0c0;\n  --border: #5a6b8a;\n  --font: \"Courier New\", \"Lucida Console\", monospace;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--panel);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0d0e17;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 460px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #0d0e17;\n}\n\n.formula {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: #1f2233;\n  color: var(--text);\n  outline: none;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s, border-color 0.1s;\n}\n\ninput:hover, select:hover {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n}\n\ninput:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 205, 117, 0.4);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0d0e17;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  border-color: #fff;\n  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);\n  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #0d0e17;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(3px, 3px);\n  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #0d0e17;\n}\n\n.result-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  padding-top: 14px;\n  border-top: 3px dashed var(--border);\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n#result {\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #0d0e17;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  body { font-size: 16px; }\n  .card { padding: 18px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const input = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst button = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = input.value.trim();\n  const x = parseFloat(raw);\n\n  if (raw === '' || !isFinite(x)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let out;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n\n  if (!isFinite(out)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nbutton.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\ninput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the text field.\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - **Celsius → Fahrenheit**\n   - **Fahrenheit → Celsius**\n4. Press **Convert** (or hit Enter in the input).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimals and no unit.\n\nEmpty or invalid (non-finite) input shows `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and labeled controls\n- `style.css` — pixel-inspired theme, responsive layout, focus/hover/pressed states\n- `script.js` — conversion logic and validation\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll controls are keyboard accessible, have visible focus outlines, and are associated with labels. The result is an `<output>` element linked to the input and select.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Works fully offline.\n- Layout adapts down to 360px wide.\n- No external assets or dependencies.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}